{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8775616382e3a060b34f3ff8f1ffb04f569edc309af23e42126690f346c24b0b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd2a207c86d7e6e489ed09e99fc5978dd4cd11b95565cc399565951ba3c77c1",
      "text": "崭新的“挑战”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000015:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000015:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd2a207c86d7e6e489ed09e99fc5978dd4cd11b95565cc399565951ba3c77c1",
      "text": "崭新的“挑战”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e501df30f18001a2d96b708ecdc63f626e686ba89a5f0f303f5c01b2c7bac01",
      "text": "早上好，两位！\n都到齐了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b38eb646b3c11e5475a44b25f202cd3cbbc74c79abe26df91730fce52a78aa67",
      "text": "好的，早上好！\n听说今天有重要的事情要宣布……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78311d8862fdadcec35939af059728a7826b1f229cd073f0aaf5088722434426",
      "text": "啊啊，正是那件事……在即将到来的纪念日，\n我们315 Production要举办演唱会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:431a0f03666e6e6e793f11ee4c3fda506051d1c29218f7739af2fb6015720928",
      "text": "这次演唱会的主题，开门见山地说……就是“挑战”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be3a7a487bce569857b444620745a4d29485d615aab5f34a8dfa30f5b1de22f",
      "text": "而且！在这场演唱会上，还要公开全员合唱的新曲，\n以及成套的新服装！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97b66908ffd60d278fda70504109f575bb23791cda0168d3f3332bbc70eff895",
      "text": "新曲和服装要设计成什么样，\n我想全权交由偶像们来决定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dc59a9ae282b5e52949cdaf73b9736e8fab296a668d1f78b6f187964cb9d989",
      "text": "在面向演出当天齐心协力推进准备的过程中所诞生的\n一体感，必将成为照亮这场演唱会的关键钥匙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0358bb88d46e313b5f801176d2c1b2aeaa8469e69f04d55d69866efbd8582a2f",
      "text": "好厉害，内容好丰富啊！能在纪念日举办\n演唱会，听起来就非常让人期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8d97afaa35238d0ac033e13b976c23cb2e4a61311d40d5ae7d4c54af6154fb1",
      "text": "是的！由偶像们亲手打造的新曲和新服装，\n也与挑战这一主题非常贴合，让人热血沸腾！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1b4ad2627e72ce9b886e1e6a4179b036ed016fe3ff597bd5da27db1f21f09e8",
      "text": "我这就去和偶像各位商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a35ba6255a4b621f22f9a95df609ac89721ca1d493810ecefd89f4c32e7aca1",
      "text": "为了能将他们的PASSION以最完美的形式融合在一起，\n全力支援就拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000093:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a6d43ed1379a369d7367e167e1e39ea99ec5ff7a648a0dd5c76b6afceebead0",
      "text": "明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000093:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "表现",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37aba08949ceb616b26ff8af5428e81d02256b374065c64c00e324a727f1a5b6",
      "text": "为了演唱会的成功，我一定会全力做好后盾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84835e5a0009e5ea86a22d5803a991e389ac80c07570d0b84195607695cf4f7a",
      "text": "我也会全力协助的。\n大家一起齐心协力，办一场精彩的演唱会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
